# Google Search Console verification
#
# 1. Go to https://search.google.com/search-console
# 2. Add property: https://www.reddivaripalli.com
# 3. Choose "HTML tag" or "HTML file" verification
# 4. If using an HTML file, place it in /public and rebuild
# 5. Submit sitemap: https://www.reddivaripalli.com/sitemap.xml
#
# Optional: set NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION in .env.local
# to inject the meta verification content automatically (wire in layout if needed).
